<https://w3id.org/mailo#Tension_PLD_AIAct_Liability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        PLD Art.4 imposes strict liability; AI Act conformity assessment is not a\r\n        defence to PLD claims. A CE-marked AI-SaMD that passes AI Act conformity\r\n        assessment may still be 'defective' under PLD if it fails in real-world\r\n        deployment. The two regimes do not create a safety harbour from each other.\r\n    "@en .
