<https://w3id.org/mailo#usesHealthStatusAsCriterion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True if the system uses an individual's health status as an automated classification criterion. Must be false (C-817/19 P_817_004 Grand Chamber prohibition)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#Tension_EHDS_GDPR_OptOut> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "EHDS Art.35 grants patients an unconditional right to opt out of secondary health data use. Where opt-out rates are elevated in a clinically significant subpopulation, the resulting training dataset violates AI Act Art.10(3) representativeness. No legislative safe harbour bridges these positions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/mailo#C_817_19> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "ECLI:EU:C:2022:491" .
